sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Producer app
    participant SQS as SQS queue
    participant W as Relay worker
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Brevo as Brevo API

    App->>SQS: SendMessage(project_id, template_key, to, payload)
    loop long-poll
        W->>SQS: ReceiveMessage
    end
    SQS-->>W: message
    W->>DB: load Project + ApiKey scope + Template
    W->>W: render subject/html (Jinja2, sandboxed)
    W->>DB: insert Message(status=processing)
    W->>Brevo: send email
    alt success
        Brevo-->>W: 201 + provider_message_id
        W->>DB: update Message(status=sent)
        W->>SQS: DeleteMessage
    else failure
        Brevo-->>W: error
        W->>DB: update Message(status=failed, attempts+=1, last_error)
        Note over W,SQS: message left un-deleted;\nvisibility timeout expiry retries;\nafter maxReceiveCount -> DLQ (redrive policy)
    end
